{"title":"Team Flag","slug":"Team_Flag","hero":null,"pageid":2964,"revid":16994,"timestamp":"2025-01-22T09:19:13Z","lastEditor":"Fireknight4802","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Classic Biome {{!}} Ferwater"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Classic Store"},{"label":"Price","value":"$3,000"},{"label":"Function","value":"To play capture the flag"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.57.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<p><i><big>\"Allows you to play capture the flag, a fun way to challenge your enemies. Joining a flag team will forcefully enable PVP for you, allowing you to use any PVP weapons you desire. Take flags from enemy teams and return them back to yours to earn points! Make sure to buy more than one flag post.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Team Flag</b> item can be bought at the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Classic_Store/\">Classic Store</a> for $3,000. You can score a maximum of 25 points.\n</p><p>There are 5 commands:\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Colour\n</th>\n<th>Flag\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blue\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Team Flag Blue\">Team Flag Blue</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Red\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Team Flag Red\">Team Flag Red</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orange\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Team Flag Orange\">Team Flag Orange</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Yellow\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Team Flag Yellow\">Team Flag Yellow</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Green\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Team Flag Green\">Team Flag Green</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"}
